      "explanation": "HO4 was triggered by evolving barriers: refusal to attend, impatience while waiting, pending results, and later physician clearance for home monitoring. The doctor changed priority appropriately at each step—urgent red flags meant emergency care, pending unreviewed tests meant staying for review if possible, and post-review stability allowed bounded home observation and follow-up.",
